# Game AI

Read `docs/ai/BOT_SPECIFICATION.md` before changing bot behavior.

- Bots use the same public commands as humans.
- Bots cannot mutate state directly.
- Bots cannot inspect hidden opponent cards or undealt cards.
- Initial bot is heuristic only; no ML, LLM, MCTS or remote services.
- Use seeded RNG for tie-breaking.
- The baseline bot never intentionally jumps Palito.
- Keep tests contractual and small: legal play, pass constraints, exchange limit, Mosca declaration, determinism.
- Do not spend time optimizing competitive strength unless explicitly requested.
